              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sherry"
            },
            "reviewBody": "6-2-22 used pecans instead of walnuts, added 1 cup of green grapes. Yummy. 6-14-22 made without the grapes, still delish but better with the grapes.",
            "datePublished": "2022-06-15T00:06:29.248Z"
          },
