              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chefkaren71"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Added 2 small cans of chicken (would have been better with cubed). Didn't have celery, wished I did. Seemed a bit bland so added about a tablespoon of horseradish dijon also (though was straight horseradish, I wouldn't have used as much). BE SURE to roast the walnuts as brings out flavor. Will definately make again.",
